{
  "version": "2.21",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "y2xNdf",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Brief · Ajustes",
      "width": 360,
      "fill": "$bg-muted",
      "cornerRadius": "$radius-md",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": "$space-4",
      "padding": "$space-5",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "X8ZiJF",
          "name": "BT",
          "fill": "$fg-default",
          "content": "Ajustes — brief",
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "O572gY",
          "name": "BB",
          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "PURPOSE\nOne Ajustes for a single-user instance (D5): the person who owns the account also owns the box, so /profile and the /admin zone are one hub with sections — cuenta, apariencia y región, tu plan, avisos, tu instancia, tus datos.\n\nENTRY POINTS\nThe fifth BottomNav tab (/settings). Its rows open /settings/account, /settings/password, /settings/plan, TOTP enrolment (auth.pen), /admin/integrations, /admin/logs, /admin/settings, Mission Control at /admin/jobs (a new tab), /admin/errors (only with developer_mode, ADR-020) and the importer (assets.pen). Errores' back arrow returns to Estado y mantenimiento, where its switch lives. En mantenimiento is what a visitor who is not signed in gets from any page while maintenance_mode is on.\n\nSCREENS (LEFT → RIGHT, BY BAND)\nCuenta: Hub · Hub · Dos pasos activa · Nombre y correo · Contraseña · Tu plan (vacío · default · error).\nIntegraciones: lista · Administrar (one source opened) · Estados (the five states) · Vacío.\nOperación: Registros · Registros · Detalle · Registros · Filtrado sin resultados · Estado y mantenimiento · Estado · Mantenimiento activo · En mantenimiento · Errores · Errores · Detalle.\nNo desktop artboards: every screen here is one column (max-w-3xl, or max-w-xl for the three forms — nombre y correo, contraseña, tu plan) inside the shell (D4).\n\nBUSINESS RULES\n• The theme applies on select and the currency PATCHes on select; nothing waits for a Guardar (D58).\n• Avisos: the bell cannot be turned off (D16); the two phone switches (Resumen de Hoy en el teléfono, Avisos en el teléfono) render only where VAPID keys exist.\n• Seguridad is a row until TOTP is enrolled; once it is, a card with the codes left and Generar códigos nuevos.\n• Tu plan: nothing is prefilled; the three shares must sum to 100 before saving; the contribution is MXN. Written here only, Hoy reads it (D156).\n• Integraciones lists every registered source, the ones not connected first. Each card says its role, its own quota in its own unit, and whose problem a non-working source is: sin API key (your instance), sin cuota (your quota), bloqueada (the provider), verificando (a key saved and still being checked; it needs a worker). Near the limit qualifies the figure ('· cerca del límite'), it is not a state. One API key per source (ADR-015).\n• Deleting a source removes it from the list; it comes back only with bin/rails stockerly:sync.\n• Estado: each switch is its own PATCH and every flip is kept in SiteConfigChange. Maintenance shows the 503 page to anyone not signed in; the owner keeps working, and login stays reachable.\n• Tus datos: Borrar movimientos keeps the account; Borrar cuenta returns the instance to the setup wizard.\n\nCOPY SOURCE\nconfig/locales/es-MX.yml — settings.*, plans.*, admin.integrations.*, admin.logs.*, admin.settings.*, admin.errors.*, mantenimiento.*. Provider descriptions and what a missing key costs: MarketData::Domain::ProviderDirectory. Manual sync names: data_sources.* (DataSourceRegistry reads them from the locale). Log messages: whatever each job wrote to SystemLog.\n\nSTATES NOT DRAWN\n• Hub · Dos pasos activa with no codes left: the subline becomes a warning box, \"Activa · ya no te queda ningún código de recuperación\".\n• Hub without developer_mode: no Errores row. Without VAPID keys: neither phone switch.\n• Avisos en el teléfono, under the switch in warning-fg: \"Bloqueaste los avisos para este sitio. Se cambia desde el navegador.\" / \"En iPhone hay que agregar Stockerly a la pantalla de inicio antes de activarlos.\" / \"Este navegador no admite avisos push.\"\n• Tu plan after saving: the flash \"Plan guardado.\"\n• Registros empty with no filter: \"Tu instancia no ha registrado nada todavía.\" Errores empty: \"Tu instancia no ha registrado ningún error.\", or \"Nada con esos filtros.\" with Limpiar filtros.\n• Registros and Errores past one page: the pager under the count.\n• Estado with no worker: Trabajos reads \"Sin worker · …\" in the warning tone; Errores (24 h) above 0 takes the same tone.\n• Estado with no recorded change: \"Todavía no hay cambios registrados.\"\n• /admin/errors with developer_mode off: back to Estado with \"Activa el modo desarrollador en Ajustes para ver esta sección.\"\n• Tus datos with nothing to delete: Borrar movimientos disabled.\n• Any screen on desktop: the same column inside the SidebarNav shell.\n\nOPEN FINDINGS\nNone with a D number.\n\nHISTORY\n→ Log · Ajustes",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
